{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Contact the practice to start a thoughtful, clinician-led series of sessions or join a short cohort to learn steady skills.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --glass-bg: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      --glass-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      --accent: #7c5cff;
      --muted: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
      --glass-radius: 14px;
      --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(12,13,20,0.45);
      --font-sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family:var(--font-sans);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg,#0f1724 0%, #061226 60%);
      color: #eef2ff;
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      display:flex;
      align-items:flex-start;
      justify-content:center;
      padding:40px 20px;
      box-sizing:border-box;
      background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg');
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-position: right top;
      background-size: 40%;
    }

    .site{
      width:100%;
      max-width:1100px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding:28px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px) saturate(120%);
    }

    header{
      display:flex;
      gap:18px;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      margin-bottom:18px;
    }
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{
      width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#42c3ff);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#021028;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(124,92,255,0.18);
    }
    nav a{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);text-decoration:none;margin-left:14px;font-weight:600}
    nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}

    main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 430px;gap:24px;align-items:start}

    .card{background:var(--glass-bg);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);border-radius:var(--glass-radius);padding:18px}

    .hero{padding:20px 12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(124,92,255,0.08), rgba(66,195,255,0.03));border:1px solid rgba(124,92,255,0.06)}
    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:20px}
    .hero p{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    .contact-form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);font-weight:600}
    input,textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:#eef2ff}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .row .col{flex:1}

    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .comparator{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .toggle{display:inline-flex;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:6px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .toggle button{border:0;background:transparent;padding:6px 12px;color:var(--muted);border-radius:999px;font-weight:700}
    .toggle button.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.06),rgba(255,255,255,0.02));color:#fff}
    .price-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:end}
    .plan{flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .plan h4{margin:0 0 6px 0}
    .big{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#fff}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Mood-to-Method */
    .moods{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
    .mood{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
    .mood.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#42c3ff);color:#021028;border-color:transparent}

    .recommend{padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.025), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#42c3ff);color:#021028;font-weight:800;border:0;cursor:pointer}

    footer{margin-top:16px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width:980px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .site{padding:18px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="site" role="document">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">TP</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="/index.html">Welcome</a>
        <a href="/about.html">Therapist</a>
        <a href="/specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
        <a href="/approach.html">Method</a>
        <a href="/fees.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="/faq.html">Answers</a>
        <a href="/book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="/contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section>
        <div class="hero card">
          <h1>Let’s plan a first step that fits your week.</h1>
          <p>{{TAGLINE}} — a gentle invitation to explore what’s useful now, with clinical clarity and practical options.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="height:12px"></div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Mood-to-Method selector</h3>
          <p class="muted">Pick how you feel and see a suggested path and a tailored first-step call-to-action.</p>
          <div style="height:10px"></div>

          <div class="moods" role="list">
            <button class="mood" data-key="overwhelmed" role="listitem">Overwhelmed</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="stuck" role="listitem">Stuck / Stalled</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="anxious" role="listitem">Anxious</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="grief" role="listitem">Sad / Grieving</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="transition" role="listitem">Life Change</button>
          </div>

          <div style="height:12px"></div>
          <div class="recommend" id="recommend">
            <strong id="rec-title">A calm, short consultation</strong>
            <p id="rec-desc" class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">If you're unsure where to begin, we can start with a 45-minute consultation focused on the most pressing piece. No pressure to continue — just clear options and a human plan.</p>
            <div style="height:10px"></div>
            <button id="primary-cta" class="cta" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="height:12px"></div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Contact form</h3>
          <form class="contact-form" id="contactForm" action="/book.html" method="get" onsubmit="return handleSubmit(event)">
            <div class="row">
              <div class="col">
                <label for="name">Your name</label>
                <input id="name" name="name" required placeholder="First & last">
              </div>
              <div class="col">
                <label for="phone">Phone</label>
                <input id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">
              </div>
            </div>
            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required placeholder="{{EMAIL}}">

            <label for="interest">I am contacting about</label>
            <select id="interest" name="interest">
              <option>Single session</option>
              <option>Short cohort</option>
              <option>Ongoing therapy</option>
              <option>Consultation for a team or program</option>
            </select>

            <label for="message">A few words about what’s happening</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="What feels most pressing?"></textarea>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:8px">
              <div class="muted">I will respond to messages within 72 hours on weekdays. For urgent or emergency needs, see the note below.</div>
              <button type="submit" class="cta">Send a note to the clinician</button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div style="height:12px"></div>

        <div class="card">
          <h4 style="margin:0">Confidentiality & scope</h4>
          <p class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">This practice provides therapy within professional ethical boundaries and confidentiality limits. Sessions and communications are not a substitute for emergency services. If you are in crisis or at risk of harm, contact local emergency services or a crisis line immediately.</p>
          <p class="muted" style="margin-top:6px">Insurance coverage varies; I can provide a superbill on request. I offer clinical therapy and cohort learning groups; these are therapeutic supports but don’t replace higher levels of care when needed.</p>
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Quick contact</h3>
          <div class="muted">Call or email to ask a scheduling question or request intake materials.</div>
          <div style="height:10px"></div>
          <div style="font-weight:800">Phone</div>
          <div class="muted">{{PHONE}}</div>
          <div style="height:8px"></div>
          <div style="font-weight:800">Email</div>
          <div class="muted">{{EMAIL}}</div>

          <div style="height:12px"></div>

          <div class="card" style="background:transparent;padding:0;border:none">
            <h4 style="margin:0 0 10px 0">Pricing comparator</h4>
            <div class="comparator">
              <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Pricing toggle">
                <button class="active" id="opt-monthly">Monthly</button>
                <button id="opt-package">Package</button>
              </div>

              <div class="price-row">
                <div class="plan">
                  <h4>Individual Sessions</h4>
                  <div class="big" id="price-ind">$150</div>
                  <div class="small">Standard 50-min session</div>
                </div>

                <div class="plan">
                  <h4>Cohort Series</h4>
                  <div class="big" id="price-cohort">$320</div>
                  <div class="small">4-week live cohort — skill-focused</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div style="height:10px"></div>
              <div class="muted">Toggle between monthly pricing and discreet package pricing — numbers animate to show the difference.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div style="height:12px"></div>

        <div class="card">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">How we’ll work</h4>
          <ol class="muted" style="padding-left:18px;margin:0">
            <li>Initial check-in: what matters most now.</li>
            <li>Short plan: 2–8 sessions or a cohort with clear takeaways.</li>
            <li>Review and next steps with referrals as needed.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

      </aside>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div>Licensed clinician in {{STATE}}. Responses are typically within 3 business days. For immediate risk, call local emergency services or a crisis line.</div>
      <div style="height:6px"></div>
      <div class="muted">This site is an invitation to care; it does not create a clinician-patient relationship until an intake is completed.</div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Pricing comparator with animated numbers
    (function(){
      const monthBtn = document.getElementById('opt-monthly');
      const packBtn = document.getElementById('opt-package');
      const priceInd = document.getElementById('price-ind');
      const priceCoh = document.getElementById('price-cohort');

      // base values
      const values = {
        monthly: {ind:150, coh:320},
        package: {ind:720, coh:280} // package: 6-session block vs cohort full price
      };

      let current = 'monthly';

      function animateValue(el, start, end, duration){
        const startTime = performance.now();
        function frame(now){
          const t = Math.min(1, (now - startTime) / duration);
          const eased = t<0.5 ? 2*t*t : -1 + (4 - 2*t)*t; // ease
          const val = Math.round(start + (end - start) * eased);
          el.textContent = '$' + val;
          if(t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(frame);
        }
        requestAnimationFrame(frame);
      }

      function setMode(mode){
        if(mode === current) return;
        const from = values[current];
        const to = values[mode];
        animateValue(priceInd, from.ind, to.ind, 640);
        animateValue(priceCoh, from.coh, to.coh, 640);
        current = mode;
      }

      monthBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        monthBtn.classList.add('active'); packBtn.classList.remove('active');
        setMode('monthly');
      });
      packBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        packBtn.classList.add('active'); monthBtn.classList.remove('active');
        setMode('package');
      });

    })();

    // Mood-to-Method logic
    (function(){
      const map = {
        overwhelmed: {
          title: 'Short rhythm reset',
          desc: 'We focus on immediate, doable adjustments — tools to reduce noise and increase clarity across your day. Often a 3–6 session arc with simple practices helps you feel steadier.',
          cta: 'Schedule a short check-in'
        },
        stuck: {
          title: 'Behavioral pairing plan',
          desc: 'We map what isn’t changing, test small experiments, and build accountability into your life so movement is more likely. A few focused sessions can produce useful shifts.',
          cta: 'Start an exploratory session'
        },
        anxious: {
          title: 'Grounding and exposure scaffold',
          desc: 'We mix immediate grounding strategies with manageable steps forward to reduce avoidance and increase agency. Sessions are collaborative and paced to your tolerance.',
          cta: 'Book a stabilizing call'
        },
        grief: {
          title: 'Space for gradual grieving',
          desc: 'Therapy here is gentle and patient-focused: we track what helps you breathe, remember, and carry on. We outline a grief-sensitive timeline together.',
          cta: 'Arrange a listening session'
        },
        transition: {
          title: 'Plan for a reset',
          desc: 'Big changes benefit from practical structure. We create a short plan with check-in points so decisions feel less overwhelming and more intentional.',
          cta: 'Talk through a transition plan'
        }
      };

      const moodButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.mood');
      const recTitle = document.getElementById('rec-title');
      const recDesc = document.getElementById('rec-desc');
      const primaryCta = document.getElementById('primary-cta');

      function clearActive(){
        moodButtons.forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active'));
      }

      moodButtons.forEach(btn=>{
        btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
          const key = btn.getAttribute('data-key');
          if(!map[key]) return;
          clearActive();
          btn.classList.add('active');
          // morph text with a tiny crossfade
          recTitle.style.opacity = 0; recDesc.style.opacity = 0; primaryCta.style.opacity = 0;
          setTimeout(()=>{
            recTitle.textContent = map[key].title;
            recDesc.textContent = map[key].desc;
            primaryCta.textContent = map[key].cta;
            // keep CTA href to the primary url placeholder
            recTitle.style.opacity = 1; recDesc.style.opacity = 1; primaryCta.style.opacity = 1;
          },180);
        });
      });

    })();

    // Contact form small handler
    function handleSubmit(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const form = e.target;
      // Minimal local validation
      const name = form.name.value.trim();
      const email = form.email.value.trim();
      if(!name || !email){
        alert('Please provide name and email.');
        return false;
      }
      // Instead of sending, direct user to booking page with query params
      const params = new URLSearchParams({name, email, interest: form.interest.value});
      location.href = '/book.html?'+params.toString();
      return false;
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# contact.html + README for private_practice_therapist

This bundle contains two files for chunk 4 of the site: contact.html and README.md. The page uses glass-morphism styling and includes two interactive local features implemented in plain JavaScript:

Features implemented in contact.html
- Mood-to-Method selector: choose a present state (Overwhelmed, Stuck, Anxious, Grief, Transition). The page updates the recommended approach and changes the CTA text to match the selected mood. The CTA link keeps the placeholder {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} so it can point to your preferred booking endpoint.
- Pricing Comparator toggle: switch between "Monthly" and "Package" pricing views. Numbers animate smoothly so visitors can compare options.
- Contact form: local client-side validation then redirects to /book.html with query parameters. This is a placeholder flow appropriate for static site prototypes.

Developer notes
- Placeholders used in the template that must be replaced or processed by your templating system: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.
- Navigation uses custom labels: Welcome, Therapist, Focus Areas, Method, Investment, Answers, Book, Connect. Links are relative to the site root.
- No external assets or CDNs are referenced. The page references a background SVG at assets/img/pattern.svg; ensure you provide a unique SVG there for the complete visual identity.

Therapist content & compliance
- The copy avoids medical claims and guarantees and includes confidentiality, scope boundaries, and a crisis note to guide urgent situations.
- The tone is clinician-forward and calm, with a playful-premium edge in visual styling.

How to run locally
1. Place this file in your web root alongside the other pages (index.html, about.html, specialties.html, approach.html, fees.html, faq.html, book.html).
2. Provide the assets/img/pattern.svg file in the indicated path.
3. Serve the folder with any static server (e.g., `python -m http.server` or a dedicated static-site host).

Customization suggestions
- Replace placeholder strings with real values from your CMS or templating pipeline.
- Update pricing numbers in the script to reflect your current rates.
- If you want the form to POST to a backend, replace the onsubmit handler and set the action appropriately.

Accessibility & responsiveness
- Basic keyboard and focus flows are supported; the layout is responsive and collapses to a single column on narrow screens.

License
- Use and adapt as needed for your private practice site. Keep clinical notices and crisis guidance intact.

Generated for: niche=private_practice_therapist, layoutFamily=glass_morphism, voiceFamily=playful_premium, offerModel=cohort."}
BUNDLE_END
